  "text": "```verilog\nmodule sync_reset #\n(\n    parameter N = 2\n)\n(\n    input  wire clk,\n    input  wire rst,\n    output wire out\n);\n\n    localparam WIDTH = (N > 0) ? N : 1;\n\n    reg [WIDTH-1:0] sync_reg;\n    reg             rst_active;\n\n    always @(posedge clk or posedge rst) begin\n        if (rst) begin\n            sync_reg   <= {WIDTH{1'b1}};\n            rst_active <= 1'b1;\n        end else begin\n            sync_reg   <= {sync_reg[WIDTH-2:0], 1'b0};\n            if (sync_reg[WIDTH-1] == 1'b0)\n                rst_active <= 1'b0;\n        end\n    end\n\n    assign out = rst_active;\n\nendmodule\n```<|im_end|>",
